<section class="block" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head center">
      <h2>Why TopBesticles</h2>
      <p>One place to find the best — and to be found when buyers (and AI) go looking.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bgrid">
      <div class="bcard">
        <span class="bg"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Straight answers</h4>
        <p>A clear #1 for each kind of buyer — not an endless wall of options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard">
        <span class="bg"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Always current</h4>
        <p>Every list shows when we last checked it, and we re-verify on a schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard">
        <span class="bg"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="8" x2="14" y2="12"/><line x1="7" y1="16" x2="14" y2="12"/><line x1="14" y1="12" x2="18" y2="6"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="1.5" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Built for AI</h4>
        <p>Clean structure and markup so AI assistants can read and cite each list.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard">
        <span class="bg"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 4v16M5 8h14M7 8l-3 6h6zM17 8l-3 6h6z"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Honest comparisons</h4>
        <p>Real trade-offs and current pricing — the stuff that actually decides it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard">
        <span class="bg"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Get discovered</h4>
        <p>Featured tools surface where buyers increasingly look: inside AI answers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bcard">
        <span class="bg"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
        <h4>One source to trust</h4>
        <p>Independent research people and machines can rely on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.bgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;}
.bcard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:26px 24px;box-shadow:var(--sh);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;}
.bcard:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--sh-h);}
.bcard .bg{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--grad);box-shadow:0 8px 18px -8px rgba(109,77,251,.7);}
.bcard h4{font-weight:600;font-size:1.18rem;margin:16px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
.bcard p{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;}
@media(max-width:820px){.bgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
</style>
